The upstream project established the request-layer kernel injection approach for
Anthropic-shaped requests. This project extends it with:

  - a separate injector for OpenAI-shaped messages[] (DeepSeek)
  - DeepSeek-specific measurements and the resulting mechanism decisions
    (no authorization block, 32000 output floor, model allowlist)
  - fingerprint-based kernel versioning for frozen per-session prompt sections
  - multi-round escalation with detection predicates and honest fallback
  - a three-protocol proxy with model-name upstream routing

The upstream MIT licence and attribution are retained as required.
